flowchart TD
    U[User question] --> S[sanitize_user_prompt<br/>length, control chars, injection]
    S -->|blocked| R1[Refusal message]
    S --> SC[check_scope<br/>pet-care only, no diagnosis]
    SC -->|blocked| R1
    SC --> A[PawPalAgent loop<br/>Gemini, max 6 steps]
    A <--> T1[search_care_guide<br/>RAG: TF-IDF over data/knowledge]
    A <--> T2[list_tasks / check_conflicts / next_free_slot<br/>Scheduler]
    A --> P[propose_task]
    P --> V[validate_proposal<br/>fields, known pet, time budget]
    V -->|invalid: error returned to model| A
    V --> H[Human approval in Streamlit]
    H -->|Approve| AP[apply_proposal re-validates, adds Task]
    A --> L[(logs/pawpal.log)]
